<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Wednesday's matches:</p>
<p>16 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>15 - Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>11 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool), Dwight Yorke (Aston Villa)</p>
<p>10 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle),</p>
<p>9 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Matthew Le Tissier</p>
<p>(Southampton), Ole Gunnar Solskjaer (Manchester United), Efan</p>
<p>Ekoku (Wimbledon)</p>
<p>8 - Gianluca Vialli (Chelsea), Dion Dublin (Coventry)</p>
</text>
